{{Quote|Grants the user the ability to manipulate spirits, which can offer the user heavenly buffs to themselves or disastrous traps to their enemies.|Shop}}
'''Spirit''' (formerly known as [[Soul]]) is a {{Mythical}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|3,400,000}} or {{Robux|2,550}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].  

Spirit grants the user control over two spirits, Ra and Shu, allowing them to manipulate spirit-based attacks, mainly revolving around {{w|Demon|Demons}} (Ra) and {{w|Angel|Angels}} (Shu).

The user can summon spirits that attack, heal, or grant speed upon being summoned, providing strong support capabilities alongside devastating [[Area of Effect|AoE]] attacks.  

